SOAPBOX: CQWW 160 CW contest from my home location. This year we had
SOAPBOX: a slightly better setup than in previous years.
SOAPBOX: TRX K3 diversity receive, amp Acom 1200S, full-size dipole
SOAPBOX: at 18 metres above sandy soil. K9AY RX loop for reception in
SOAPBOX: four directions. Two ops (PA8R and PA5PR) working hard to
SOAPBOX: fill the log. Unfortunately, conditions were so poor that we
SOAPBOX: were only able to log two stations outside Europe. Hopefully
SOAPBOX: next year will be better.
